"description": "Colruyt Group NV engages in the retail and distribution of food and non-food products and fuels. It operates through the following segments: Food, Health & Well-Being and Non-Food, and Group Activities, Real Estate and Energy. The Food segment engages in the retail and distribution of food products through company-owned stores and online channels, while also supplying wholesalers, food service operators, professional customers, and other businesses. The Health & Well-Being and Non-Food segment engages in the sale of health, wellness, fashion, pharmaceutical, cycling, and other non-food products through brands such as Newpharma, Jims, The Fashion Society, and Bike Republic. The Group Activities, Real Estate and Energy segment engages in energy operations and provides shared support, corporate, digital, IT, technical, and real estate services that primarily support the group's business segments. The company was founded by Franz Colruyt in 1928 and is headquartered in Halle, Belgium.",
